00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:53.540
like Spring Boot or
some other types.

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:58.490
And where do you want to
store the generated artifacts?

00:11:58.490 --> 00:12:01.880
If you want to generate
the microservice based

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:04.190
on the swagger by
default, you can

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:09.410
specify the swagger information,
and the Java-based class,

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:11.970
and some other informations.

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:15.560
And for Istio, right,
so you need to specify,

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:16.970
where is your cluster.

00:12:16.970 --> 00:12:21.030
Where do you want to
deploy these apps to?

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:25.740
I really can change or add
