need to configure it.

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:53.660
Let me run this service.

00:12:56.530 --> 00:12:57.840
OK.

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:00.460
It will take a few seconds.

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:03.360
But you will see
a new folder will

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:08.430
be created in the repository.

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:13.780
Now, it's started generating.

00:13:13.780 --> 00:13:19.675
And the Istio configuration
